sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant UI as Web界面
    participant Msg as Message
    participant Noti as Notification
    participant DB as 数据库

    U->>UI: 在对方主页点击发私信
    UI->>Msg: openRoom(peerId)
    Msg->>DB: 查询或 INSERT dm_rooms
    Msg-->>UI: roomId + 历史消息
    U->>UI: 输入内容并发送
    UI->>Msg: send(roomId, content)
    alt 内容为空或非会话成员
        Msg-->>UI: code=400/404
    else 合法
        Msg->>DB: INSERT dm_messages
        Msg->>Noti: notifyMessage
        Noti->>DB: INSERT notifications
        Msg-->>UI: code=200
        UI-->>U: 消息上屏
    end
